# The special name data selects an occurrence (the author 2026-11-11, R6, said of the root; plan M11 5a): a run over
# itself is its data, and data\[1]Model is the second record Model, with three fields. Here the run is that of main:
# data is read in its code and, as a path piece, from the root through main\data.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the
# call main().
sub: main () (
    Model: a b
    Model: c d e
    int: in_code 0
)
    in_code := length(data\[1]Model)
main()
int: seen length(main\data\[1]Model)
int: seen_in_code main\data\in_code
